  {
   "name": "Historical surveys and inventory documentation",
   "status": "ongoing",
   "summary": "The commission regularly allocates funds to hire consultants for Massachusetts Historical Commission Form B property inventories when evaluating demolition applications and neighborhood history. The body coordinated multi-year, grant-funded neighborhood surveys across Medford, completing inventories in the Brickyards, Fulton Heights, and Boynton subdivisions. Commission members also developed plans for a searchable digital wiki database of existing inventory records and pursued survey grants for Sagamore Vale, Hastings Heights, and the Brooks Estate area. In late 2026, the commission selected the Lawrence Estates area north of Medford Square as the target priority for the next state survey and planning grant cycle.",
